        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Whether you are <strong>arriving at Surat Thani Airport</strong> to explore Khao Sok National Park, or preparing for your <strong>return journey from Khao Sok to Surat Thani</strong> to catch a flight, this guide covers all your transport options. Surat Thani airport is a big favorite of ours because of its small size, laid-back feeling, and high ratio of coffee shops to customers. However, getting from the airport to Riverside Cottages can be challenging.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Quick Facts</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Distance: ~103 km (64 <a href="https://www.unitconverters.net/length/miles-to-km.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">miles</a>)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
