            <span><strong>Pros</strong>: Very cheap</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cons</strong>: Multiple transfers, longer trip</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Private Taxi or Transfer</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Taxi</strong>: ฿1,500 (metered/negotiated), ~1.5 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Private transfer</strong>: ฿2,000 total or ~฿1,000–1,050 pp (shared, pre-booked)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Pros</strong>: Fastest, reliable, door-to-door</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cons</strong>: More expensive</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>From Other Airports</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>From Phuket</strong>: ~3 hours by car, ~5 hours by bus</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>From Krabi</strong>: ~5–6 hours</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Traveling Back: Khao Sok to Surat Thani</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Just as many travelers fly into Surat Thani, most of them also need to <strong>return to Surat Thani Airport or city</strong>. The journey from the national park to Surat Thani offers most of the same transport choices but requires some planning around schedules.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Shared Minivan (Khao Sok → Surat Thani)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Available at local travel agencies and guesthouses</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cost</strong>: ฿250–300 per person</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Duration</strong>: ~2.5 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Drop-off points</strong>: Surat Thani Airport, Surat Thani Town, or ferry piers for Koh Samui/Koh Phangan/Koh Tao</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Departure times</strong>: Typically morning and early afternoon (check locally)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Tip</strong>: Book 1 day in advance, especially in high season</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Bus from Khao Sok to Surat Thani</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Surat Thani Bus Route</strong>: Local bus station→ Surat Thani Town → Airport or ferry piers</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cost</strong>: ฿400–600</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Duration</strong>: 4.5–5 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Best for</strong>: Budget travelers with no time pressure</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Private Transfer</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cost</strong>: ฿1,500–2,000 (car for 2–3 people)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Duration</strong>: ~1.5 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Perfect for</strong>: Early morning or late-night flights when buses/vans aren’t running</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Compare Travel Options</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/70 shadow-md">
          <table width="100%"><thead><tr><th align="left">Route Direction</th><th align="left">Transport Option</th><th align="left">Price (THB)</th><th align="left">Duration</th><th align="left">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">Surat Thani → Khao Sok</td><td align="left">Shared van</td><td align="left">250–300</td><td align="left">2.5 hrs</td><td align="left">Direct from airport</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Surat Thani → Khao Sok</td><td align="left">Taxi/private transfer</td><td align="left">1,500–2,000</td><td align="left">1.5 hrs</td><td align="left">Fastest & most comfortable</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Surat Thani → Khao Sok</td><td align="left">Bus via town</td><td align="left">400–600</td><td align="left">4.5–5 hrs</td><td align="left">Cheapest but slowest</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Khao Sok → Surat Thani</td><td align="left">Shared van</td><td align="left">250–300</td><td align="left">2.5 hrs</td><td align="left">Book via hotel reception</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Khao Sok → Surat Thani</td><td align="left">Taxi/private transfer</td><td align="left">1,500–2,000</td><td align="left">1.5 hrs</td><td align="left">Best for catching flights</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Khao Sok → Surat Thani</td><td align="left">Bus via town</td><td align="left">400–600</td><td align="left">4.5–5 hrs</td><td align="left">Budget option but less convenient</td></tr></tbody></table>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>FAQ: Surat Thani to Khao Sok & Back</span>
        </h2>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Where is Khlong Phanom National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khlong Phanom National Park is located about <strong>30–40 minutes from Khao Sok village in Surat Thani Province, southern Thailand</strong>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring on the tour?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We recommend <strong>trekking shoes, insect repellent, water, swimwear and a small waterproof bag for valuables</strong>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What are the best things to do in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can enjoy Khao Sok from the water with lake trips, river tubing, and canoe tours. You can also trek through the jungle, enjoy a night safari, bathe elephants, relax with a massage, and learn jungle cooking. These are some of the best things to do in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is the Cave, Raft & Hike tour suitable for beginners?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The tour is <strong>moderately active</strong>, but most visitors with basic fitness can participate. The jungle hike includes uneven terrain and short climbs.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Tam Kaew Cave safe to visit?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, when visited with experienced guides. <strong>Visitor numbers are limited and guides lead all cave explorations to ensure safety and protect the cave environment.</strong>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Khao Sok a good place for kids?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok is a family friendly destination. Many of the river and jungle experiences are gentle and suitable for children. <a href="/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Riverside Cottages</a> can help you find activities that will be enjoyable for the whole family. <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find out more ..</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long does the Cave, Raft & Hike tour take?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The experience typically lasts <strong>5–6 hours</strong>, including bamboo rafting, jungle hiking, cave exploration and lunch.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do you explore Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can explore some of Khao Sok on your own, but the best experience is to go with a local guide. They will be able to point out wildlife and give you interesting facts about the area.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How can I book Khao Sok tours?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
